        "title": [
          {
            "kind": "text",
            "value": "When does the document header end?"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "blocks": [
          {
            "context": "paragraph",
            "id": null,
            "inlines": [
              {
                "kind": "text",
                "value": "The header is optional when the "
              },
              {
                "id": null,
                "inlines": [
                  {
                    "kind": "text",
                    "value": "doctype"
                  }
                ],
                "kind": "monospace",
                "roles": []
              },
              {
                "kind": "text",
                "value": " is "
              },
              {
                "id": null,
                "inlines": [
                  {
                    "kind": "text",
                    "value": "article"
                  }
                ],
                "kind": "monospace",
                "roles": []
              },
              {
                "kind": "text",
                "value": " or "
              },
              {
                "id": null,
                "inlines": [
                  {
                    "kind": "text",
                    "value": "book"
                  }
                ],
                "kind": "monospace",
                "roles": []
              },
              {
                "kind": "text",
                "value": ". A header is required when the document type is "
              },
              {
                "id": null,
                "inlines": [
                  {
                    "kind": "text",
                    "value": "manpage"
                  }
                ],
                "kind": "monospace",
                "roles": []
              },
              {
                "kind": "text",
                "value": ". See the "
              },
              {
                "inlines": [
                  {
                    "kind": "text",
                    "value": "manpage doctype"
                  }
                ],
                "kind": "xref",
                "target": "asciidoctor:manpage-backend:index.html"
              },
              {
                "kind": "text",
                "value": " section for manual page (man page) requirements."
              }
            ],
            "roles": [],
            "title": null
          },
          {
            "context": "paragraph",
            "id": null,
            "inlines": [
              {
                "kind": "text",
                "value": "If you put content blocks above the document header when using the default article doctype, you will see the following warning:"
              }
            ],
            "roles": [],
            "title": null
          },
          {
            "context": "literal",
            "id": null,
            "inlines": [
              {
                "kind": "text",
                "value": "level 0 sections can only be used when doctype is book"
              }
            ],
            "language": null,
            "roles": [],
            "title": null
          },
          {
            "context": "paragraph",
            "id": null,
            "inlines": [
              {
                "kind": "text",
                "value": "While this warning can be mitigated by changing the doctype to book, it may lead to a secondary warning about an invalid part. That’s because the document title will be repurposed as a part title and any lines that follow it as content blocks. If you’re going to use the book doctype, you must structure your document to use "
              },
              {
                "inlines": [
                  {
                    "kind": "text",
                    "value": "sections:parts.html"
                  }
                ],
                "kind": "xref",
                "target": "sections:parts.html"
              },
              {
                "kind": "text",
                "value": "."
              }
            ],
            "roles": [],
            "title": null
          }
        ],
        "context": "section",
