            "inlines": [
              {
                "kind": "text",
                "value": "Many static site generators, such as Jekyll and Middleman, rely on front matter added to the top of the document to determine how to convert the content. Asciidoctor has a number of attributes available to correctly handle front matter. See "
              },
              {
                "inlines": [
                  {
                    "kind": "text",
